### Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/task_manager_war/tasks
Accept: application/json

### Get one task
GET http://localhost:8080/task_manager_war/tasks?id=1
Accept: application/json

### Filter tasks by assignee
GET http://localhost:8080/task_manager_war/tasks?assigneeId=1
Accept: application/json

### Add task
POST http://localhost:8080/task_manager_war/tasks/add
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Implement authentication",
  "estimatedMinutes": 120,
  "assigneeId": 1,
  "projectId": 1
}

### Update task
PUT http://localhost:8080/task_manager_war/tasks/update?id=1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated task title",
  "estimatedMinutes": 90,
  "assigneeId": 2,
  "projectId": 1
}

### Delete task
DELETE http://localhost:8080/task_manager_war/tasks/delete?id=1
Accept: application/json
